      "side": 1,
      "message": "Note that this CL changes tetherInternal so it only removes the request it is currently bringing up, whereas before this CL, tetherInternal would remove any request of the same type. This is OK because all codepaths that can reach tetherInternal behave correctly:\n\ntetherInternal\n- enableIpServing\n  - BluetoothCallback#onAvailable\n    - getOrCreatePendingTetheringRequest\n      --\u003e OK\n  - EthernetCallback#onAvailable\n    - getOrCreatePendingTetheringRequest\n      --\u003e OK\n  - setVirtualMachineTethering\n    - enableTetheringInternal\n      - startTethering\n        --\u003e OK (request is passed in)\n      - EVENT_REQUEST_CHANGE_DOWNSTREAM\n        --\u003e OK (TETHERING_VIRTTUAL requests do not remain pending)\n  - enableWifiP2pIpServing\n    - createImplicitLocalOnlyTetheringRequest\n      --\u003e OK (requests with TETHERING_WIFI_P2P cannot exist)\n  - enableWifiIpServing\n    - IFACE_IP_MODE_TETHERED\n      - getOrCreatePendingTetheringRequest\n        --\u003e OK\n    - IFACE_IP_MODE_LOCAL_ONLY\n      - createImplicitLocalOnlyTetheringRequest\n        --\u003e OK (WIFI+LOCAL is different from WIFI+GLOBAL, and requests for WIFI+LOCAL cannot exist)\n  - enableUsbIpServing\n    - getOrCreatePendingTetheringRequest\n      --\u003e OK\n- handleLegacyTether\n  --\u003e OK (can\u0027t happen at the same time as fuzzy-matching)",
